---
source: pulldown-cmark-mdcat/tests/render.rs
expression: "render_to_string(markdown_file, &ansi_settings)"
input_file: pulldown-cmark-mdcat/tests/markdown/samples/tables.md
---
Explicit line breaks in a cell:

──────────
]777;mdcat-table;5,1\ [1ma[0m      [1mb[0m 
──────────
]777;mdcat-table;5,1\ line1  x 
]777;mdcat-table;5,1\ line2    
[2m[90m ──────── [0m
]777;mdcat-table;5,1\ b      c 
──────────
]777;mdcat-table;\
Wide cell content wraps to fit the terminal:

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
]777;mdcat-table;78\ [1mhead[0m                                                                           
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
]777;mdcat-table;78\ This is a long cell that should wrap across multiple lines because its content 
]777;mdcat-table;78\ exceeds the eighty column default terminal width used in these render tests.   
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
]777;mdcat-table;\
Column widths are distributed proportionally, without breaking a short word
apart just to make room for a long neighbour:

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
]777;mdcat-table;5,71\ [1ma[0m      [1mb[0m                                                                       
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
]777;mdcat-table;5,71\ short  this cell has quite a lot of content that needs wrapping to fit, unlike 
]777;mdcat-table;5,71\        its narrow single-word neighbour                                        
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
]777;mdcat-table;\
